    stage: 'with-knots-found',
    prong: 'knots',
    title: 'Whether a knot is a stable thing',
    design: `Longitudinal: blinded mapping repeated over weeks and months`,
    what: `The same people's knots might be mapped again over weeks and months, against their own map of perforators,
